# FAILURES.md

Record real failures and how you responded. Include unresolved failures and workarounds; honest evidence demonstrates persistence.

## Failure record template

### F## — [SHORT TITLE]
- Date/time:
- Pipeline stage:
- Environment / GPU / model revision:
- Expected behaviour:
- Actual error or observed failure:
- Reproduction steps:
- Attempts made:
- Resolution or workaround:
- Remaining limitation:
- Related log / issue / output:

## Common risks to watch

- API quota or rate limit exhausted.
- Colab runtime reset or time limit.
- GPU out-of-memory.
- Character identity drift or temporal flicker.
- Garbled image text or malformed hands/faces.
- Amharic pronunciation or prosody issue.
- Music masks narration or has unwanted vocals.
- Subtitle timing or safe-area problem.
- Audio/video duration mismatch.

These are potential risks, not claims that the project has encountered them.
